  gof_map = GOF_MAP,
  stars   = c("*" = .05, "**" = .01, "***" = .001),
  title   = "Table B8.17. Local Income (ASHE) and Cultural Immigration Attitudes: Main Effects (Englishness)",
  notes   = "Individual and wave FE. SEs clustered by respondent. DV: immigCultural.",
  escape  = FALSE,
  output  = "kableExtra"
) |> kable_styling()
```

```{r b8-engl-income-int}
